        <a href="signup.html">注册</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <h2>最新动态</h2>
        <div class="post">
            <h3>李明</h3>
            <p>今天天气真好，去公园走走。</p>
            <img src="data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAUAAAAFCAYAAACNbyblAAAAHElEQVQI12P4//8/w+N0eYk0AAkYAQgK1YqX8AAAAASUVORK5CYII=" alt="公园">
        </div>
        <div class="post">
            <h3>张丽</h3>
            <p>分享我最喜欢的歌曲：周杰伦 - 《晴天》</p>
        </div>
        <div class="post">
            <h3>王伟</h3>
